Date: Sun, 11 Oct 2026 15:38:01 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 4/4] datamap: add the Data Map service and start it with the
 system server

Collects the names and counts of DNS lookups and TCP connects per user, in memory unless the user keeps
a history; derives the links on read; audits what the user changed, never what was collected.
